# Triple Triad: Bot1's upkeep exiles its Lightning Bolt (mana value 1) and Bot2's Counterspell (mana value 2). "Each other card
# exiled this way with lesser mana value than it": the Counterspell is greater, so Bot1 may not play it, even for no mana; its own
# Bolt can be cast, for no mana, at Bot2 (positive control).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Triple Triad
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x9
Counterspell
Island x10

